{"t":"Devious Dragons (Book)","s":"devious-dragons-book-d9f51","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Book_Black_3404b6.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Untitled</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Book (Black)\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Black_3404b6.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Plains%20of%20Havoc\">Plains of Havoc</a>, in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Plains%20of%20Havoc%2FDragon%20Lair\">Dragon Lair</a>.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"blurb\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Short Description</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Krendorak was trying to discover the secret of his ancestors, but was tricked by the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragons\">Dragons</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"author\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Author</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Krendorak</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatedpages\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Related Articles</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Plains%20of%20Havoc%2FDragon%20Lair\">Plains of Havoc/Dragon Lair</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Nightmare%20Knights\">Nightmare Knights</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Knightwatch%20Tower\">Knightwatch Tower</a>, Camdrek.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"returnpage\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Return to</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Plains of Havoc Library.</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Libraries <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This book has no notes.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-text\">\n<blockquote class=\"book\"><p><br/>This is the Journal of Krendorak, \n</p><p>the last of the Nightmare Knights:\nI tried to discover the secret of my ancestors, but I failed. \nThe damned dragons tricked me! \nI escaped but I know I'm mortaly wounded. \nEven if I could get out off here, I will never make it to Knightwatch Tower to \nuse its secret to resupply.\nSince now that Camdrek is dead I will never be able to open it...\nIt is so hot, my sight is fading...\n</p><p>\nMay the gods forgive my failing...</p></blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["ornamented-shield-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"ornamented-shield-quest","quest":"Ornamented Shield Quest","kind":"reward"}]}}